# Rust Protocol Proof

The app-plan WP13 protocol proof is the shared app/game WP14 Rust protocol
proof:

- `crates/agent-protocol/src/app_game.rs`
- `crates/agent-protocol/src/app_game_tests.rs`
- `crates/agent-core/src/activity_store_app_game/app_game_journal_sqlite_ingest.rs`
- `crates/agent-core/src/activity_store_app_game/app_game_journal_sqlite_ingest_tests.rs`

Validation:

```text
cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game_journal_sqlite -- --nocapture
PASS: 3 tests.

cargo test -p ocentra-parent-agent-core app_game -- --nocapture
PASS: 41 tests.
```
